        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "12Riven: The Psi-Climinal of Integral",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "12Riven is a visual novel in which the player makes progress by reading the game's story. At certain points during conversations with other characters, the player is given a set of choices. Depending on what the player chooses, the story diverges into different branches, eventually leading to different endings; there is only one \"true ending\"",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "12Riven es una novela visual en la que el jugador avanza leyendo la historia del juego. En ciertos momentos de las conversaciones con otros personajes, se le presenta al jugador un conjunto de opciones. Según lo que elija, la historia se bifurca en distintas ramas que conducen finalmente a distintos finales; existe un único \"final verdadero\".",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
